step Defeat Nek'rosh
  when group 474
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Chieftain Nek'rosh is a level 32 elite: most classes solo it at level 34, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  tip Careful: Shadowcasters stand on either side of him, and at least one is linked to him, so it joins when he is pulled. Non-elite centurions and captains are spread around his ring of tents.
  collect 3625 quest 474.1 @53.5,54.7 map 1437

