step Southshore
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Pick up everything in town before heading out. Micha Yance and Bartolo Ginsetti stand between the flight master and the inn, Farren and Barkeep Kelly at the inn, Maleb in the town hall.
  # An Alarming Request requires level 30 (Forever's quest data, quest 92432, checked 2026-10-14).
